                "EditorError: Failed when trying to get input from editor Failed to open `{}` as a text editor or editor was terminated with errors.",
                editor
            ))
        }
    }
    match std::fs::read(&tmp) {
        Ok(b) => Ok(String::from_utf8_lossy(&b).to_string()),
        Err(_) => Err(format!(
            "EditorError: Failed when trying to get input from editor Failed to open `{}` as a text editor or editor was terminated with errors.",
            editor
        )),
    }
}

fn cmd_help(m: &Matches, bin: &str) -> i32 {
    let names = m.values_of("subcommand");
